iant is making a play in the hotly contested AI cybersecurity arena.","image_url":"https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6b0f74e5591baa03/blt34f6e6891ab6cce7/6a6915f75cb22e64f02e4748/microsoft.jpg?width=720&quality=80&disable=upscale","author":"Shaun Sutner"},{"id":"d3fb8b5c604877a0","title":"Data\u2011First Security Strategies for Enterprise AI","url":"https://emerj.com/data-first-security-strategies-for-enterprise-ai/","source_name":"Emerj AI","published_at":"2026-07-28T14:54:43","tags":[],"audiences":["business"],"slug":"data-first-security-strategies-for-enterprise-ai-d3fb8b5c604877a0","summary":"This interview analysis is sponsored by Securiti and was written, edited, and published in alignment with our Emerj sponsored content guidelines. Learn more about our thought leadership and content creation services on our Emerj Media Services page. The promise of enterprise AI meets a reality where models and agents can access sensitive data faster than [\u2026]","author":"Marilie Fouche"},{"id":"2b49d6a1ee309fc8","title":"Modus Raises $10M Seed Led by Insight Partners to Build the Context Warehouse for Enterprise AI","url":"https://hackernoon.com/modus-raises-$10m-seed-led-by-insight-partners-to-build-the-context-warehouse-for-enterprise-ai?source=rss","source_name":"Hacker Noon AI","published_at":"2026-07-29T11:26:06","tags":[],"audiences":["business"],"slug":"modus-raises-10m-seed-led-by-insight-partners-to-build-the-context-warehouse-for-2b49d6a1ee309fc8","summary":"Modus Raises $10M Seed Led by Insight Partners to Build the Context Warehouse for Enterprise AIRead All","author":"ruth_hasson"}],"total":10,"limit":500,"offset":0}